le` on large files like `pipeline.py` which previously failed; use skeletons and chunks instead.\n\nIMPORTANT ERRORS / POLICY EVENTS:\n- A previous attempt to `read_file` on `modules/agent/orchestration/pipeline.py` was blocked for being too large, reinforcing the need to use chunked/skeleton reads on large files.\n\nEXECUTION SNAPSHOT\ntask_kind=INSPECTION\nrecent_read_files=modules/agent/intent_runtime.py@vNone[2900,3635), modules/agent/intent_runtime.py@vNone[44472,54209)\nprotected_working_material=2\ndo_not_reread_without_reason=true\n\nContinue the current task normally. Do not answer with a summary unless the user explicitly asks for one."
